:: OC Luca Mall Candy Store Encounter [nobr]

/* Intro */
You are wandering the mall shopping with your eyes at the various window displays trying to decide where you want to go when you spot a familiar dirty blonde-haired boy with long socks. <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Luca</span>! <span style="color:Yellow">He is staring into a candy shop, face fulling planted against the glass with a sad, desperate look on his face.</span> The store is currently closed, but you can see a worker inside setting it up to open. The man glances at <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Luca</span> curiously, who watches him like a zombie hungry for flesh. It is quite the unusual sight. Curious as to what is the cause of this, you walk up to <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Luca</span> and greet him. <br>

