<span style="color:LightSteelBlue">“Oh, hey <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">$Player.Name</span>!”</span> He says, turning to you quickly as his frown of desperation turns into a big smile, <span style="color:LightSteelBlue">“What are you doing here? Oh, are you waiting for the shop to open as well? I just can’t wait, I heard they have a bunch of new flavors I just have to try and-”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Luca</span> is talking at a million words per minute, causing your head to spin from the barrage of this hyper-active boy’s ramblings. <span style="color:LightSteelBlue">“-and I don’t even know how they made a cucumber one, but I bet it’s great! You have to try them, wanna come in with me?”</span> The boy finally stops talking and looks at you expectedly. It takes a few seconds for your brain to catch up on what he’s asked you. <br>
<br>

<div id="choice">
    <<link "Accept<br>">>
    <<replace"#choice">>
        <span style="color:LightGreen">Thinking it would be fun, especially since <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Luca</span> is offering to pay, you take him up on his offer.</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Luca</span> smiles widely and leaps into the air, having more energy than you’d know what to do with. <span style="color:LightSteelBlue">“Great! Oh, I can’t wait to try all the new flavors! Which one are you the most excited about, I’m thinking it’s either the-”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Luca</span> begins to go on another long, hyperactive ramble that you mentally prepare yourself for when suddenly the door is unlocked, and the store is open. <br>
        <br>
        Without wasting a second, <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Luca</span> grabs you by the wrist and drags you inside, nearly knocking over the teenage cashier who opened the door as your friend yanks you over to the large, colorful selection of candies on display. It honestly is a little overwhelming just how many varieties they have, but <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Luca</span> seems even more excited as he stands there, mouth-agape, as he marvels at all the flavors. Despite the fact that he has obviously been to this store many times before. <br>
        <br>
        The store sells candy per ounce, so <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Luca</span> quickly grabs a bag and begins to fill it with handfuls and handfuls of candy of all shapes, sizes, and colors. You don’t even have the time to read what some of the flavors are before his bag is overflowing with assorted sweets. <span style="color:Pink">The boy sure loves candy and, while a bit childish, it is extremely cute.</span> The bag full, <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Luca</span> drags you to the cashier and the bag is weighed and total displayed. <br>
        <br>
        <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Luca</span> pulls out an adorable green frog wallet and begins to count out his cash <span style="color:LightCoral">only to discover he is two dollars short!</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Luca</span> gasps, pulling his wallet open as much as he can and peering inside. <span style="color:LightSteelBlue">“What!? I swore I had enough for a full bag!”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Luca</span> turns his wallet upside down, but alas, <span style="color:LightCoral">it is empty.</span> As he realizes he is going to have to put at least a dozen or so pieces back from his bag, he looks down like a sad dejected puppy. You are thinking about offering to help him pay for it when the teenager on the register speaks out. <br>
        <br>
        <span style="color:LightSteelBlue">“Dang, tough luck. Maybe if you give yourself an atomic wedgie I’ll give you a discount.”</span> The teenager laughs playfully as he presses some buttons and the register opens. <span style="color:LightSteelBlue">“I’m just kidding kid, I got you-”</span> As he reaches for the cash, you both suddenly realize that <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Luca</span>, <span style="color:Pink">in his desperation, had already started to give himself a massive wedgie! His adorably kiddie dinosaur briefs already yanked painfully up to just below his shoulders!</span> <br>
        
