        <span style="color:LightSteelBlue">“O- oh…”</span> <span style="color:Pink"><span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Luca</span> turns bright red as he realizes the boy was just messing with him, releasing his underwear as it snaps painfully against his back. The teenager rolls his eyes and chuckles as a slightly embarrassed <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Luca</span> fixes his wedgie.</span> <br>
        <br>
        <span style="color:LightSteelBlue">“You’re pretty wild kid.”</span> The teenager laughs, <span style="color:LightSteelBlue">“But maybe don’t be so quick to humiliate yourself for candy? Trust me, it isn’t worth it.”</span> <br>
        <br>
        <span style="color:LightSteelBlue">“But it’s just so gooooood~!”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Luca</span> says with joy as he takes his overflowing bag of sweets. <span style="color:LightSteelBlue">“Any wedgie is worth this confections deliciousness!”</span> You and the teenager boy share a smirk and laugh as <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Luca</span>, <span style="color:Pink">underwear still slightly poking out,</span> takes you outside to taste the spoils of every cent of his allowance. <span style="color:LightSteelBlue">“So, which one do you want to try first? This one? Or – Oh! – How about this one?”</span> He asks, holding up strangely colored pieces of candy <span style="color:Pink">before you inform him of his underwear still sticking out and he blushingly fixes them.</span> <br>
        <br>
        <span style="color:LightSteelBlue">“Guess I got a little carried away, hehe.”</span> He rubs the back of his head, slightly embarrassed. <span style="color:LightSteelBlue">“Mind keeping it our little secret?”</span> You laugh and agree, popping one of the strangely colored candies into your mouth. The only way you can describe the flavor is ‘interesting’. 
        <<if $Player.Traits.includes("SugarCrazed")>>
            <span style="color:LightGreen">You understand <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Luca</span>’s craving for these things. When you’re craving sweets, a wedgie or even something more embarrassing doesn’t seem that bad.</span> <br>
            <br>
        <<else>>
            <br>
            <br>
        <</if>>
        The two of you then spend the next few minutes enjoying the sweets without a care of the stomachache they may give you later. <span style="color:LightGreen"><span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Luca</span> is a pretty good friend for sharing these with you.</span> <br>
